window.products.push({"id":889059,"name":"Dulce Cocina Absorbent Coasters - Save Your Table From Damages Without Losing Your Style, Felt Drink Coaster Set of 6 In Ivory Tree Pattern","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61734yOvLlL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"\" I have used thirsty stone coasters in the past and they obviously were never thirsty enough. I would always have water dripping down over the coaster and I would have to use paper towels under the thirsty stone coasters to catch the moisture. Well, no more paper towels. These felt coasters are parched.\" Set of 4 Ivory - 10*10*0.5cm In fact we would not use them as coasters at all. We would much rather show them off since let's face it; they are far too lovely to spoil. They can work as a centerpiece for an ornament or vase; they can be utilized as a standalone house décor item and they can be utilized to put your coffee on. Truly, the sheer attraction and vibrancy of these certain coasters would actually set the tone for your house or yard and be incredibly presentable for those events when you want that extra zest. You could make numerous magical moments, both romantically and in a friendly entertaining way with these coasters. They are incredibly stylish and would make an extremely thoughtful present.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61734yOvLlL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Dulce Cocina","source_asin":"B00KA9W18A","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-889059","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00KA9W18A","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00KA9W18A","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":889060,"name":"Latest 3.25-Inch Paring Knife - Our Knives Are Expertly Crafted With High Carbon, Stainless Steel For Performance and Durability","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/614s+1-jBpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Having the right paring knife to hand can be the difference between having kitchen nightmares and genuinely looking forward to cooking! For detail work, such as deseeding small chilies, deveining shrimp, or creating small julienne strips, a paring knife is the best choice. Now you can handle the most intricate food prep like a pro! The Chef Remi Paring Knife is designed to be the ultimate tool for all exacting food preparation that requires nimbleness. This ‘mini chef’s knife’ is much smaller and more maneuverable than a standard chef’s knife, which makes precision tasks in the kitchen much easier and faster. Add to that, the curved blade allows you to cut at various angles. And the sharp spear point allows you cut into fruit and vegetables to remove their cores, or carry out extremely delicate work, such as removing the thin vein on shrimps. Our Chef Remi Paring Knife is designed to be your go-to tool for whenever you need more dexterity and precision than a chef’s knife can provide. The razor-sharp, food-grade stainless steel blade will cut food with laser sharp preciseness. Stainless steel is lighter than heavy carbon steel, so it is easier to wield, and you can comfortably prep foods for long periods, eliminating hand fatigue, pain or tension. Stainless steel is also naturally corrosion and rust free, and we’ve added extra chromium, so the blade edge will remain razor sharp, even after many uses. Treat yourself to the Chef Remi Paring Knife. Stop stressing over exacting, demanding food prep, and say hello to precision and simplicity!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/614s+1-jBpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Chef Remi","source_asin":"B0756TWHMY","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-889060","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0756TWHMY","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0756TWHMY","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
