window.products.push({"id":889094,"name":"GLYY Olive Oil Sprayer for Cooking - 210ml Dispenser Bottle Spray Mister Portable Refillable Food Grade Vinegar Spritzer Bottles Kitchen, Air Fryer, S","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":9.97,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71E6P6SIk3L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Easily Control the Amount of Oil, Give You Healthy Life.The improved oil spray nozzle of the olive oil sprayer can easily control the amount of oil sprayed. The cooking oil sprayer bottle sprays evenly and reduces waste.Oil Sprayer for cookingDifferent way different effect:(1) If you want to get foggy effect, you need press the handle to the end and press quickly; the faster and harder you press the handle, the more pressure, the finer mist you will get.(2) If you want to get a columnar, you only press the handle to halfway down and slowly.If the bottom of the straw is not in the same direction as the nozzle, please pull out the straw and adjust it in the same direction.Warm Tips:1. When you use the oil bottle for grilling, do not spray it on, or near an open flame or fire.2. We do not recommend using these sprayers to spray high-density oil, it may clog the nozzle.3. The best way to spray is hold the sprayer with 45 degree, press the middle of the button instead of the edge.4. As the oil is easy to solidify(especially winter), it may clogged the tip, cause the sprayer spray a stream.5. Please do not put the product in the dishwasher, sterilization cabinet, microwave oven, and other electrical appliances.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71E6P6SIk3L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"GLYY","source_asin":"B092YLFXF2","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-889094","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B092YLFXF2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B092YLFXF2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
