window.products.push({"id":889099,"name":"Cole & Mason Herb and Spice Rack with Spices - Revolving Countertop Carousel Set Includes 16 Filled Glass Jar Bottles","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71DMVeXZGkL._AC_SL1365_.jpg","description":"The Cole & Mason Herb & Spice Carousel displays 16 glass jars with all your favorite spices. Not all jars are filled. Spices included are caraway seed, coriander seed, cumin seed, fennel seed, ground basil, ground bay leaves, ground cinnamon, ground chili flakes, ground dill, ground marjoram, ground mint, ground oregano, ground paprika, ground parsley, ground rosemary, ground thyme. The spice jars hang on a beautifully designed carousel to be displayed on your counter or in your kitchen cabinet. Jars have both a shake and a pour function. Tops are chrome plated and pre-marked for popular spices. Established in 1919, Cole & Mason's world-renowned salt and pepper mills remain wholly designed in England. With mill designs from traditional to modern, these innovative mills not only enhance your home and food with function and optimum flavor, but bring great style too. Every kitchen and home deserves a mill that delivers the ultimate in seasoning time and time again. The Cole & Mason Precision Mechanism distinguishes itself from typical pepper mills and guarantees to deliver a seasoning experience that will really bring out the best in your food. Rather than simply crushing the peppercorns, the advanced mechanism instead strips them down by their individual layers as it grinds. As the different flavors within these layers are released they mix together to deliver the fully rounded and intense flavor of the peppercorn. This true and pleasurable flavor of the peppercorn enhances your food with a difference that you can really taste.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71DMVeXZGkL._AC_SL1365_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Cole & Mason","source_asin":"B00BM7HPG2","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-889099","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00BM7HPG2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00BM7HPG2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
