window.products.push({"id":889206,"name":"Menu Magnet Black Floral","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71bzcUCCZHL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"What's for dinner? It's all here on your fabulous weekly menu! When you plan with this Dry Erase Menu Magnet, there will be no last minute guess work when preparing meals. Save money on groceries as you buy just the things you will really use, letting no food go to waste. Planning ahead and committing to make healthier meals with this weekly dry erase menu will help you to feed your family the way you want to. Simply place this menu on a magnetic surface such as a refrigerator, back door or magnet board and you’re ready to go! Use a dry erase or chalk marker to jot down your week’s meals. When the week's over, simply wipe away the meals and replace them with next week's fare. Erase easily with a soft cloth. This Menu is a part of our Mix & Match Magnetic System that includes dry erase monthly calendars, weekly calendars, note boards, birthday calendars, and chore charts. Our clever and versatile system will help you create an office or family “Command Center” that suites your space and organizing needs. Don’t forget to include a set of dry erase and chalk markers. Menu Plan your weekly menu, shopping lists, and more Organize yourself to save money on groceries and eat healthier meals! Dry-erase surface with magnet back Dry-erase / wet erase friendly Chalk pen friendly too. Get that fun chalkboard look, but without the mess! Mix & Match magnetic system 11.75” high X 7.5” wide Markers sold separately Brand Name: Ala Board Colors: Gray, Teal, Yellow Quantity: 1 dry erase menu magnet Material: magnet Dimensions: 7.5'' W x 11.75'' H Item Weight: 5.9 oz Menu Area: 7” W X 9.75” Packaging: The magnet come in a plastic sleeve with care instructions. Setup: SImply open the package and place on magnetic surface. Care: Erase with a soft, 100% cotton material. For a more thorough cleaning, use a dry erase spray cleaner. IMPORTANT: USE ONLY CHALK MARKERS - REGULAR DRY ERASE MARKERS WILL NOT WORK ON THE BLACK FLUORESCENT CALENDAR!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71bzcUCCZHL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Ala Board","source_asin":"B00MV2TDV2","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-889206","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00MV2TDV2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00MV2TDV2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
