window.products.push({"id":889221,"name":"INNOMAX Luxury Support Harmony Dual Digital Pillow Top Air Bed Mattress, California King","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":1749.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81x4AGU5NsL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Featuring the latest in technology, the luxury support harmony premium dual digital sleep mattress by InnoMax is constructed with premium damask finely fashioned in fully gusseted pillow top design with tack & jump quilting for durability and comfort. The harmony air bed allows you to choose your personal comfort level from medically recognized sleep support settings. Premium support materials are combined with impeccable tailoring assembled with pride in the USA to produce a sleep environment that offers maximum comfort. The harmony hi-tech tack & jump quilt design provides an overall plusher feel than tight top models while reducing surface tension to provide the best night's sleep. Exclusive anatomic support layer provides five separately designed zones for head to toe comfort. A proprietary moisture barrier protects mattress and allows for cleaning of the sleep system interior. A high performance pump features four-function operation and digital sleep controls are user friendly with easy to read led digital readout. Multi-Directional box baffle air chambers are designed for maximum air flow in all directions to provide full body support and enhance comfort. A steel reinforced kink-free air deployment hose incorporates the cam lock connectors that are easy to use. Quality assured mattresses, pumps and air chambers are put through an extensive battery of quality control tests checking overall construction, with direct focus on all connections to ensure long trouble free use. While old fashioned beds often produce pressure points, InnoMax digital sleep mattresses conform to the body for improved circulation and better sleep. At the touch of a button, you can customize the correct support to fit your personal preference, from extra firm to feather soft. This is essential for couples because people of different sizes and weights have different sleep support needs. With InnoMax digital sleep systems, couples never have to compromise.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81x4AGU5NsL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"INNOMAX","source_asin":"B018NZIX6G","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-889221","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B018NZIX6G","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B018NZIX6G","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
