window.products.push({"id":889234,"name":"Cuisinart 66-7 Chef's Classic Nonstick Hard-Anodized 7-Piece Cookware Set","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":119.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/7122Ef5xmwL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Bringing the Good Life Home Inspired by the great French kitchens, Cuisinart began making professional cookware over 30 years ago. Constructed of the finest materials available, to perfectly perform all of the classic cooking techniques. Designed to last a lifetime, Cuisinart cookware makes family meals memorable and entertaining a pleasure. Savor the Good Life right at home, with family and friends. Cuisinart makes it absolutely delicious. Designed from the inside out for today's lifestyles, our Non-Stick Hard Anodized Cookware combines uncompromising superior cooking performance with a professional look. Cuisinart Non-Stick Hard Anodized Cookware exterior is harder than stainless steel for durability and professional performance. We guarantee a lifetime of healthy cooking with Cuisinart Chef’s Classic Non-Stick Hard Anodized Cookware. Chef’s Classic Hard Anodized 7-Pc Set: With two saucepans, a stockpot, and a skillet, you have all the basic tools to make great meals in a variety of ways. What's in the Box 1.5 Quart Saucepan w/ Cover, 3 Quart Saucepan w/ Cover, 8 Quart Stockpot w/ Cover, and 10” Open Skillet. Product Features Hard Anodized Exterior Harder than stainless steel. Dense, nonporous, and highly wear-resistant for extra durability and professional performance. Highest Quality Quantanium Non-Stick Interior Titanium reinforced nonstick cooking surface for healthier cooking, lasting food release and easy cleaning. Metal utensil safe. The Coolest Touch in Home Cooking Cast stainless steel Cool Grip™ stick handles are contoured for a secure grip and designed to stay cool on the stovetop. Perfect Balance Riveted stainless steel handles, including side grips and helper handles, are professionally riveted to ensure a lifetime of perfect balance. Flavor Lock Lid Tightfitting stainless steel lids fit tight to lock in flavor, texture and nutrients. Wide, easy grip handles. Drip-Free Pouring Rims of cookware are tapered to make pouring clean and easy. Versatile Performance Oven safe to 500°F. Cook on stovetop, in oven, or under broiler. Freezer safe for easy food storage. Dishwasher Safe Brilliant stainless steel comes out of the dishwasher looking like new. Lifetime Warranty About the Pieces 10 inch Skillet: Nonstick skillets provide healthier, fat-free browning and frying options.. 1,5 and 3 Qt. Saucepans w/ Covers: No other piece of cookware performs with the versatility of a saucepan. A kitchen essential with a Quantanium nonstick cooking surface that requires no butter or oil. 8 Qt. Stockpot w. Cover: Designed for slow cooking and maximum reduction of liquids. Produces more concentrated and flavorful results.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/7122Ef5xmwL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Cuisinart","source_asin":"B0001LO5HW","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-889234","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0001LO5HW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0001LO5HW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":889235,"name":"LADYMOON Adhesive Curtain Rod Holder,Transparent Tension Bracket,No Drilling(Not Included)（Only For Rods Less Than 1 Inch in Diameter at Both Ends）(4 ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":9.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/512l-oGmvHL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"✔️【Design and use】 -Tension rod bracket holder is simple and stylish in appearance, the fixings are free of branding and other logos and the transparent design blends better with your home. The four corners are curved for a safer and stronger attachment. More suitable for shower curtain rods,wardrobe applicable tension rods, and tension rods for storage better fixed to the wall. (This product is only suitable for tension rods, curtain rods etc. with a diameter of less than 1\" at both ends) ✔️【Product Advantages】 - Shower rod curved tension no drill, will not damage the surface integrity of the wall, cabinet and other materials, installation is convenient and simple, one person will be able to operate independently to complete the support at both ends of the tension rod to play a better, stronger weight-bearing role, do not have to worry about the curtain rod, tension rod will fall due to excessive heavy. ✔️【Installation Method】 - Adhesive curtain rod bracket no drilling above window,first tear off one side of the double-sided adhesive film, paste in the location where you need to paste, and then tear off the other side of the patch film, the curtain rod holder and patch stick together and patch stick together, sit firmly and keep 4-6 hours can be used. ✔️【 Important Tip】 - No drill curtain rod brackets for most smooth surfaces, such as (tile, glass, wood cabinets, smooth metal surfaces, etc.), but not for textured walls or rough not smooth will be de powdered walls, such as. (latex paint wall, outdoor uneven rough brick wall, cement wall, dusty wall,wallpaper) If your wall is rough can't stick to the wall smoothly and you want to put the heavy rod directly on this curtain rod holder, we don't recommend you to use this product. ✔️【Excellent Service 】- If you have any problem, please feel free to contact us, we provide high quality after-sales servicewe will try our best to solve your problem within 24 hours!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/512l-oGmvHL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"LADYMOON","source_asin":"B0BBMTHG31","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-889235","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BBMTHG31","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BBMTHG31","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
