window.products.push({"id":889261,"name":"MadeTerra Wooden Clip on Cup Holder Hanging Shelf, Small Bedside Table, Flexible with 2 Clip Sets 1\" and 1.4\" (Natural)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/817NKtwxs-L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"STYLISH BEDSIDE CUP SHELF - Adding ease and convenience to your chilling time in bed, this cup holder tray can be held on the side of your bed, bunk bed or dorm bed, high sleeper or mid sleeper. With the two fixed spots, you can rest assured that your cups are well- protected inside the holder. Its hooks allow this adorable drink holder to be moved along the rail of your bed for easy and flexible use. The brown color of the rack also adds a nice rustic touch to your bedroom decor. VERSATILE DRINK HOLDER - Our Hanging Cup Holder comes with 4 stainless metal hooks of 2 different widths ( 1.02 inch/26mm and 1.37 inch/ 35mm) and 4 screws. You can change the hook size easily to fit any handrails on any furniture. This rack can be used as a milk bottle holder on baby craddle in you nursery room, wine bottle and glass holder on the arm of your backyard rocking chair, even as season jars holder on your kitchen counter. The usage is unlimited. CREATIVE HANDRAIL DÉCOR SHELF - If you are a décor lover, here's a good news. Thanks to its rustic and vintage vibe, our hanging cup shelf can also be used as an eye-catching décor piece. A great idea could be to hang your small planters and ornaments beside your bathtub, on your staircase handrails, on your balcony. Get creative and add a nice natural charm to your home. PROTECTING MOTHER EARTH - This chair arm cup holder is made from acacia, a plant that is sustainable grown and harvested in Vietnam. It is environmentally friendly from every angle. Acacia does not leave an excess of negative impacts due to harvesting and transportation. When compared with plastics and rubber, wooden cup holders made of natural acacia wood are far more ecologically sound. YOUR PURCHASE MAKES AN IMPACT - MadeTerra is a local maker-to-market company by artisans in Vietnam. This Clip On Cup Holder, just as every item sold under the brand name of MadeTerra, is handcrafted by the very hands of skilled artisans in Phu Xuyen, homeland of acacia handicrafting in Vietnam. With every purchase you make, you are making a difference, contributing to global fair trade, supporting artisan communities and preserving the indigenous crafts and cultures.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/817NKtwxs-L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"MadeTerra","source_asin":"B08MTD1W1Q","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-889261","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08MTD1W1Q","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08MTD1W1Q","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
