window.products.push({"id":889276,"name":"FGSAEOR Magnetic Measuring Spoons Set, Dual Sided, Stainless Steel, Fits in Spice Jars, Black, Set of 8","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":8.39,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71ATGP4MvXL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"👨‍🍳[Durable and Sturdy Stainless Steel] - Our magnetic measuring spoons set are made from food-grade all stainless steel one piece construction with no plastic, so the handles won’t come off or become loose overtime. You won’t see any indication that shows any scratches or wear-off measurements labels even after several times washes or uses. No sharp edges on the spoon set makes it safe to use. 👨‍🍳[Double-Headed Design] - Each stainless steel measuring spoon comes with a round spoon on one end and a narrow shaped spoon on the other. There is usually a recipe that calls for a liquid and a dry teaspoon ingredient, for instance a tbsp of flour and water. While cooking you can use one side for dry and the other for wet ingredients, so there is no need to clean, dry wet spoons or have multiple spoons out. 👨‍🍳[Accurate Measurements in Volume and Weight] - With bright white letters, the engraving marking on each teaspoon is huge, clear and easy to read, which won’t fade away after washes, so no more struggling to read. And these teaspoon measuring spoons can measure lots of things, such as water, flour, salt, sugar and other liquid. 👨‍🍳[Fit into Most Containers] - Two-end design allows for it to fit nicely into most containers, such as herb spices, spice jars and different bottles. One end is round and the other is more slender, making it easier to get into small-mouthed containers. The bottom of the metal measuring spoons are flat so the contents won’t spill over when set it on a flat surface. 👨‍🍳[Value Pack] - This package comes with 7 table spoons measuring spoon (1/8, 1/4, 1/2 , 3/4, 1 tsp, 1/2, 1 tbsp) and 1 additional leveler. These measuring spoons set stainless steel keep together in a neat stack and keep organized. The leveler is used to level off your ingredients to make it an exact measurement when you scoop into dry ingredients.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71ATGP4MvXL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"FGSAEOR","source_asin":"B0BH8S1D4G","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-889276","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BH8S1D4G","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BH8S1D4G","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
