window.products.push({"id":889350,"name":"Deluxe 2 pk Cupcake 12 Cup Non-Stick Muffin Pan - 24 Cupcakes With a Spatula","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61jKLmnOgNL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Deluxe 2 pk Cupcake 12 Cup Non-Stick Muffin Pan - 24 Cupcakes With a Spatula By Elaine Karen This modern and updated Cupcake, Muffin Meatloaf non-stick oven tray is for the standard cupcake baking. The heavy gauge construction provides even heating performance throughout the pan. Baking experts prefer this baking pan for perfectly browned bakes goods. The non-stick coating makes the food release and clean up a breeze. No more waiting until the first batch comes out of the oven, we are providing you with 2 trays so you can bake both of them in the oven at once, saves oven energy and time! Bonus Spatula to help you distribute you cupcake mix into the pans. This spatula which is made of strong, durable quality is what you need to finish off mixing; the color may vary. This cupcake pan is perfect for your morning muffin, and afternoon snack. This is what every home needs. Finish off your party with cupcakes, making the party more personal while every guest gets their own cupcake. This pan does not rust; it lasts for years always looking new. Better than silicon pans, these are more durable and long lasting. Best of all these are dishwasher safe, so after baking just stick them into the dishwasher for fast cleaning. 2 pans, each makes 12 standard cupcakes. Includes a spatula – color may vary. Measures 14 x 10.5 x 1.25 inches. Non-stick coating , super easy to clean. Durable and long lasting, always looks new. Ideal gift for every occasion. Satisfaction Guaranteed Deluxe 24 cupcake standard muffin pans are backed by a 30 day 100% MONEY BACK Warranty. No questions asked! Order Now!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61jKLmnOgNL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Elaine Karen","source_asin":"B0783R2FYB","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-889350","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0783R2FYB","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0783R2FYB","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":889351,"name":"Bethlehem Lighting Indoor/Outdoor Christmas Standard Star Sphere 100, Amber","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51EE7CVCT2L._AC_.jpg","description":"Product Description GKI/Bethlehem Lighting excels in making quality Christmas lights! Long-lasting brilliance! Each lamp shines with rich color and remarkable intensity for more than 3000 hours! Plus, the string stays lit if one bulb goes out. GKI/Bethlehem Lighting uses 200mA lamps to ensure the greatest possible brightness. Steadfast reliability! The GKI/Bethlehem Lighting patented external lamp lock prevents loose connections--the most common flaw of light set failure. Locked in their sockets, lamps will not come loose. Twist-Proof lamps provide added security and eliminate misaligned wire contacts. Safety Certified--Lights are UL listed. GKI/Bethlehem Miniature Light Sets are guaranteed to light for 3 years from date of purchase or 3000 hours of use, which ever comes first. Amazon.com This decorative starlight sphere from GKI/Bethlehem Lighting is adorned with 100 mini lights and, while it's perfect for holiday decorating, it can also be used year round, indoors or outdoors. Measuring 7-1/2 inches in diameter, the light sphere has a 144-inch lead, and it's available in a wide variety of lighting colors. GKI/Bethlehem Lighting excels in making quality holiday lights with long-lasting brilliance. Each lamp shines with rich color and remarkable intensity for more than 3000 hours, or for three years from the date of purchase, whichever comes first. GKI/Bethlehem Lighting uses 200mA lamps to ensure the greatest possible brightness. The patented external lamp lock prevents loose connections, which is the most common reason for light set failure. Locked in their sockets, lamps will not come loose. Twist-proof lamps provide added security and eliminate misaligned wire contacts. Safety certified, the lights are UL listed for indoor and outdoor use. Starlight spheres are also available in a Mini 50-light model, and a Mega 150-light model.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51EE7CVCT2L._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Bethlehem Lighting","source_asin":"B001KZI2A4","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-889351","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B001KZI2A4","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B001KZI2A4","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
