window.products.push({"id":889939,"name":"Mugod Bath Towel Blue and Gold Beautiful Macaw Parrot Bird Showing Its Vivid Feathets Decorative Soft Highly Absorbent Luxury Bath Towels Home Hotel S","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":19.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61-WXc4oMNL._AC_SL1250_.jpg","description":"Mugod bath towel made of ultra-absorbent dual pile microfiber thoroughly dries your body and hair faster and gentler than traditional fibers; on rough or very dry skin microfiber can feel a little like it's \"clinging\" to your skin.Towels will quickly dry when hanging to help prevent the formation of odors. Item specifics: Material: 100% Soft Polyester-microfiber Larger Size: 32\" x 64\"/ 81 x 163cm Pattern Type: Solid Type:Bath Towel, Hair Towel, Beach Towel Shape:Rectangle Package Include: 1 x Bath Towel","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61-WXc4oMNL._AC_SL1250_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Mugod","source_asin":"B07TYQJ2Q2","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-889939","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07TYQJ2Q2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07TYQJ2Q2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":889940,"name":"Attractive Set of 10 Hammered Highball Drinking Glasses 17-oz, Home & Party Glassware Set","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61UfVQHDFkL._AC_SL1024_.jpg","description":"Highnall glasses","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61UfVQHDFkL._AC_SL1024_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"GFSmart","source_asin":"B00KAGMUJ8","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-889940","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00KAGMUJ8","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00KAGMUJ8","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":889941,"name":"YellRin Oyster Shucking Knife Stainless Steel with Wooden Non-Slip Handle Leather Sheath and Resistant Gloves (Oyster Shucking Knife)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":19.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71LwWFVdz8L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Package Include:  1*Oyster Shucking Knife  1*Leather Sheath  1* Pair of Cut-Resistant Gloves   Features of The Oyster Shucker with Cut Proof Gloves Set :  1. The durable and solid wood handle ensures a firm, comfortable grip.  2. Stainless steel blade gives the knife the strength it needs to open oysters and makes it incredibly durable for years of use.  3. The large guard will protect your hands from hitting sharp pieces from the oyster shell.  4. Versatile enough for any shape and species of oyster or shellfish. Gift for any special occasion and for any oyster lover.  5. Equipped with the no cut gloves, making you safer and more productive.   How to open an oyster  1.Clean the outside of the oyster under running water to remove any loose grit or barnacles. Rub the shell with your fingers or use a stiff brush if you have one for this purpose.  2.Hold the oyster in a towel or oven mitt with the hinge (pointed side) sticking out. This will protect your hand if the oyster knife slips.  3.With the flat side of the oyster up, insert the tip of our oyster knife near the hinge. You only need to insert the knife about 1/2 inch.Do not use a regular knife to open oysters. There is too great a risk of slipping and severely injuring yourself.  4.Holding the oyster firmly, slide the knife around the lip of the oyster until you reach the other side of the hinge. The oyster should remain level, so you don't lose the liquid inside. Keep the knife inserted about 1/2 inch with the tip pointed slightly up.  5.Keep the oyster level and pry the shell apart with your fingers. Before separating the shells completely, use the oyster knife to detach any muscle that still clings to the inside of the top shell. Remove the top shell.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71LwWFVdz8L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"YellRin","source_asin":"B08G1G29RY","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-889941","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08G1G29RY","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08G1G29RY","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":889942,"name":"[2 PCs] Insulated Coffee Mug, 14 Oz Stainless Steel Coffee Mug With Lid Handle & Soft Handle Cover, Double Wall Vacuum Insulated Coffee Mugs Spill Pro","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71wzXj9qAyL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"✅【Double Wall Vacuum Insulated Coffee Mug】: the 14oz coffee cap is made of premium food-grade 18/8 stainless steel, which provides with double-wall vacuum insulation to keep your favorite beverages hot for 3+ hours and cold for 9+ hours, also can repel stains and odors, meaning your lemonade won't taste like yesterday's coffee. Moreover, it makes the mug durable and not easy to break. ✅【Stainless Steel Coffee Mug With Soft Wide Handle】: Owing to the wild silica gel full-loop handle, AIDEAMART coffee mug is comfort-grip, non-slippery, free of metal cold feeling and is more comfortable to grip, making it easy to drink from. Coffee cup with handle and lid is a great outdoor travel mug and perfect coffee mug in home and office. ✅【Splash-proof & BPA Free Flip-top Lid】: The coffee tumbler comes with a DUST-PROOF press-in lid made from BPA-Free Tritan material. For this lid, we have two rubber gaskets for you to improve the spill-proof performance, which can help keep your wine or coffee from sloshing out. In addition, through the flip-top lid, you can use straw, sip, drink and enjoy your coffee or other drinks in any way you like. And you can easily see how much of your drink have left through durable clear lid. ✅【Matte Powder Coated & Sweat Free】This coffee tumbler never sweats or fades with durable premium powder coating techology for additional texture and durability. The No Sweat design ensures your hands stay dry. If you are a coffee addict who can drink more freshly brewed hot coffee a day, the mug will justify your expectations and does not sweat. If you are an icy beer lover, your hand will never get frostnip. ✅【Elegant Gift & 100% Customer Satisfaction】: All the stainless steel mug by AIDEAMART is coated with a stylish matte finish and laser logo. Some cups are designed with beautiful 3D patterns and personalized quotation language. Great for fast and simple use, personalized party favors, backyard BBQs, his-and-hers gifts, Father's Day and Mother's Day gifts. if you are not fully satisfied with your purchase, just feel free to contact us. We will make every effort to solve your problem.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71wzXj9qAyL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"AIDEAMART","source_asin":"B08V53XWJJ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-889942","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08V53XWJJ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08V53XWJJ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
